  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Applying expansion series, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mf